	\L_0275d:
	PF0 VAR0056:
	\L_026d1:
	ZH 1:
	'The next day.'
	\L_027be:
	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　　Leazas Castle'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'  Middle of a Nearby Road'
	\L_027be:
	ZH 1:
	'Code was standing with Kanami,'
	R
	'prepared for a simple journey.'
	\L_027be:
	ZH 1:
	'Their hands were clasped tight,'
	R
	'like they would never let go'
	R
	'of each other.'
	\L_027be:
	\L_027b1:
	\L_02709:
	ZH 1:
	'Are you ready...?'
	\L_027be:
	\L_027b1:
	\L_02699:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah... Yeah...'
	\L_027be:
	\L_027b1:
	\L_026d1:
	ZH 1:
	'Kanami was staring at Leazas'
	R
	'Castle.'
	\L_027be:
	\L_027b1:
	\L_02699:
	ZH 1:
	'...Goodbye...'
	\L_027be:
	\L_027b1:
	\L_026d1:
	ZH 1:
	'Kanami gave her parting words'
	R
	'to the scene she would never'
	R
	'see again.'
	\L_027be:
	\L_027b1:
	\L_02699:
	ZH 1:
	'...?'
	\L_027be:
	ZH 1:
	'Uu...'
	\L_027be:
	\L_027b1:
	\L_02709:
	ZH 1:
	'Kanami!?'
	\L_027be:
	\L_027b1:
	\L_026d1:
	ZH 1:
	'Kanami was a bit choked up and'
	R
	'sat down.'
	\L_027be:
	\L_027b1:
	\L_02709:
	ZH 1:
	'What’s wrong...?'
	R
	'Are you hurt...?'
	\L_027be:
	\L_027b1:
	\L_02699:
	ZH 1:
	'N-No...'
	\L_027be:
	ZH 1:
	'I’m fine... Probably...'
	\L_027be:
	\L_027b1:
	\L_026b5:
	ZH 1:
	'...Come to think of it...'
	\L_027be:
	ZH 1:
	'Aren’t I supposed to be on my'
	R
	'period...? Could it be...?!!'
	\L_027be:
	\L_027b1:
	\L_026fb:
	\L_0276b:
	\L_026d1:
	ZH 1:
	'After the King was lost...'
	\L_027be:
	ZH 1:
	'Leazas was subject to Lia’s'
	R
	'reckless behavior after she went'
	R
	'mad and collapsed in not even'
	\L_027be:
	ZH 1:
	'half a year.'
	\L_027be:
	\L_027b1:
